l}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-15T18:34:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T06:24:24Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T23:18:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-15T23:18:27Z"},"body":"Guess who forgot to make a PR **8 months ago**. I think it was because I wanted to tweak the surrounding documentation, but it wasn't strictly necessary for the purposes of this PR.\r\nSimilar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113217\r\n\r\nThe title is self-explanatory. This PR renames the `method` parameter to `callable` in many Array methods. It does _not_ change the signatures of the underlying C++ methods ~~in order to reduce some diff noise, unless requested~~ **because it was already changed to `p_callable`**.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nArray's `filter`, `map`, `all` etc. These methods were added at a time where **Callable** was being figured out (early Godot `4.0`). It doesn't take much to realize why the parameter's name is disgusting, but I will nonetheless:\r\n- It's exceedingly misleading.\r\n- It implies that only methods can be passed.\r\n- If not the above, it implies that all \"callables\" are referred to as \"methods\".\r\n\t- \"_[param method] is a callable that_\" 🤢 \r\n- It muddies the context between \"this method\" and \"the parameter named `method`\"\r\n\r\nPossible alternative names include `callback`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121426/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121426/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}